        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An RPG where your character fights automatically, even when you're offline!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain levels, craft equipment, and optimize your build to face stronger enemies who'll challenge your character's power in different ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you advance, you'll unlock new ways to help you strengthen your character - you can focus on growing your garden of beneficial plants, growing your knowledge of monsters in the Bestiary, or creating a powerful deck in the card-based minigame! There are a dozen different subsystems you'll unlock as you advance that'll keep shaking up how you play!</p>",
